    <h2>Private label</h2>
    <p>We can pack retail-ready formats — pouches, jars, branded cartons — under your own label for products where that's a practical option (spices, pulses, dehydrated products and some grain packs are the most common private-label requests). Send your target retail format, artwork requirements and destination market's labelling regulations, and we'll confirm what's achievable and at what minimum quantity.</p>

    <h2>Bulk supply contracts</h2>
    <p>For distributors, wholesalers and processors needing a consistent volume over time rather than a one-off order, we can discuss quarterly or annual supply arrangements with agreed specification, pricing review terms and delivery scheduling. This works well for animal feed ingredients, fertilizers, staple grains and pulses where demand is steady rather than seasonal.</p>

    <h2>What we need from you to scope a proposal</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Product(s) and target specification</li>
      <li>Expected volume per shipment and over what period (monthly, quarterly, annual)</li>
      <li>Destination port(s)</li>
      <li>Packaging/private-label requirements, if any</li>
      <li>Your business type — retail chain, distributor, processor, wholesaler</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Send this through the form below and we'll come back with a proposal, including whether a trial order makes sense before committing to a longer-term contract.</p>
